                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="390 1502 390 1517 2157 1513 2159 1498 2153 1465 1754 1468 1728 1457 1726 1457 1724 1457 1722 1457 1683 1468 1581 1457 1579 1457 1577 1457 1575 1457 1559 1470 1248 1470 1200 1459 1198 1459 1196 1459 1193 1459 1146 1470 1074 1459 1072 1459 1007 1470 929 1459 927 1459 847 1470 700 1459 697 1459 695 1459 652 1470 630 1459 628 1459 503 1459 500 1459 498 1459 468 1470 416 1459 414 1459 412 1459 388 1470 390 1502"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="the Middle Anadyr. After that, the government, tired of an expensive and"/>
                    </TextLine>

